# Live backend (Contabo)

The product API is **`https://api.larisid.com`** on Contabo (`root@84.247.147.205`).
The old cloud project `bzmvlraziqevqdyotvgy` is **gone**.

**Never** `supabase db push`, `supabase db push --linked`, cloud PATs (`sbp_…`),
or the Supabase Dashboard / MCP against that old ref. They do not update the
